# Wallpapers from each theme's community collection, which `wallpaper --fetch`
# (run by ./install.sh --niri) downloads once and recolours into every variant
# of its family (catppuccin: frappe, macchiato, mocha), each in
# ~/.local/share/wallpapers/{variant}/, machine-local. Only this list is in the
# repo: the images are other people's work, under their collections' terms.
# Super+Alt+W cycles through the theme's own glow wallpaper ({variant}.svg
# here) and its variant's recoloured ones. Paths may hold spaces. The family
# column says which variants an image is made for, not where it comes from:
# Dracula's own collection is mostly distro logos, so it borrows from others.
